  Description: Real-time WebSocket connectivity examples for connecting Glasses to ESP32, Arduino, Raspberry Pi, and any standards-compliant WebSocket server. Includes TextEcho (simple echo client), IMUData (IMU sensor receiver), and IMUCube (3D rotation handler) with full Logger support, SnapDecorators, and complete Arduino/ESP-IDF server implementations.
